omp-web (0.3.7) jammy; urgency=medium

  * chat: surface an error when an image attachment is skipped for being
    oversized, an unsupported type, or over the per-message cap, instead of
    dropping it silently (closes #34).
  * release: stamp package.json's version from debian/changelog at build time,
    so /api/health and NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_VERSION match the installed package and
    update detection compares real versions (closes #32).
  * sidebar: replace the update-check banner with a small current-version
    readout sized for the drawer's strip mode (closes #33).

