omp-web (0.3.6) jammy; urgency=medium

  * rpc-manager: give every browser conversation its own agent id and share the
    process AsyncJobManager, so subagents run as background jobs in every
    conversation instead of blocking the turn from the second one onward
    (refs #29). Carries a bun patch against @oh-my-pi/pi-coding-agent 17.3.0.
  * model-roles: configure per-role backup models (retry.fallbackChains) from
    the browser, with inherited chains shown distinctly (refs #30).
  * model-rotation: per-conversation sticky round-robin across a role pool,
    opt-in per role, off by default (refs #31).

